 "limitation": "A PROXY for how mortgaged a community is: it counts mortgages registered against homes bought in the period, not the share of all existing homes carrying a mortgage (that census figure is not published). Mortgages registered at off-plan handover or on refinancing inflate the numerator, so a few communities reach the 100 cap. Off-plan-heavy communities read low because pre-registration sales rarely carry a mortgage at purchase.",
